@page "/about"
@layout MarketingLayout

<PageTitle>About | MoneyBrain</PageTitle>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="marketing-hero">
    <div class="marketing-hero-content">
        <h1>Built for <span class="highlight">financial freedom</span></h1>
        <p>MoneyBrain is an open-source personal finance system designed for people who value privacy, correctness, and data ownership.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Story -->
<section class="marketing-about">
    <div class="marketing-about-content">
        <h2>Why we built MoneyBrain</h2>
        <p>
            We believe managing money shouldn't require giving up your privacy. Most personal finance apps 
            sync your data to the cloud, track your behavior, and lock you into their ecosystem. 
            We wanted something different.
        </p>
        <p>
            MoneyBrain is built on a simple principle: your financial data belongs to you. It runs on your 
            server, stores data in a local database, and never phones home. There's no telemetry, no 
            analytics, and no third-party integrations that compromise your privacy.
        </p>
        <p>
            We focus on correctness over cleverness. Every feature is designed to be predictable and 
            deterministic. Your account balances will always match your expectations because we enforce 
            strict invariants: transactions can't be modified after reconciliation, transfers always 
            affect exactly two accounts, and split transactions must always balance.
        </p>
        
        <div class="marketing-values">
            <div class="marketing-value">
                <h4>Privacy First</h4>
                <p>Your data stays on your server. No cloud sync, no tracking.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-value">
                <h4>Correctness</h4>
                <p>Strict invariants ensure your books always balance.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-value">
                <h4>Simplicity</h4>
                <p>Clean interface focused on what matters, not flashy features.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-value">
                <h4>Open Source</h4>
                <p>Inspect the code, contribute, or fork it for your needs.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Non-Goals -->
<section class="marketing-features" style="background: var(--mb-bg-secondary);">
    <div class="marketing-container">
        <div class="marketing-section-header">
            <h2>What MoneyBrain is not</h2>
            <p>We focus on doing a few things well rather than being everything to everyone</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="marketing-features-grid" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
            <div class="marketing-feature-card">
                <h3>No Bank Sync</h3>
                <p>We don't connect to banks or financial institutions. Import your data via CSV to maintain full control.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-feature-card">
                <h3>No Business Accounting</h3>
                <p>MoneyBrain is for personal finance. No invoicing, payroll, or accounts receivable features.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-feature-card">
                <h3>No Tax Filing</h3>
                <p>We help you track spending, not file taxes. Consult a professional for tax advice.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-feature-card">
                <h3>No AI Advice</h3>
                <p>We show you the numbers clearly. We don't generate financial advice or recommendations.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Tech Stack -->
<section class="marketing-about">
    <div class="marketing-about-content">
        <h2>Built with modern technology</h2>
        <p>
            MoneyBrain is built with .NET 10, Blazor, and MudBlazor for a fast, responsive experience. 
            SQLite provides a simple, file-based database that's easy to backup and portable.
        </p>
        <p>
            The codebase prioritizes clarity over cleverness. We use nullable reference types, 
            structured logging, and follow clean architecture principles. Contributions are welcome!
        </p>
        
        <div class="marketing-values" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
            <div class="marketing-value">
                <h4>.NET 10</h4>
                <p>Modern, cross-platform framework</p>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-value">
                <h4>Blazor</h4>
                <p>Interactive UI with C#</p>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-value">
                <h4>SQLite</h4>
                <p>Simple, portable database</p>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-value">
                <h4>MudBlazor</h4>
                <p>Material Design components</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="marketing-cta">
    <div class="marketing-container">
        <h2>Join the community</h2>
        <p>MoneyBrain is open source. Star us on GitHub, report issues, or contribute code.</p>
        <div class="marketing-hero-buttons">
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Class="mb-btn-primary" Size="MudBlazor.Size.Large" Href="/Account/Register">
                Get Started
            </MudButton>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Size="MudBlazor.Size.Large" Href="https://github.com" Target="_blank">
                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Custom.Brands.GitHub" Class="me-2" />
                View on GitHub
            </MudButton>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
